WEBVTT

1
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:15,660
Sounds a bit familiar

2
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:18,030
Let’s play a little game, guest

3
00:00:18,030 --> 00:00:19,870
Guess my identity

4
00:00:19,870 --> 00:00:22,510
I will give you an extra gift

5
00:00:22,510 --> 00:00:24,340
This is it

6
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:26,260
This is carriage No. 1, right?

7
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:27,460
What's the matter

8
00:00:27,460 --> 00:00:32,350
You can come to me at any time in Car No. 1, so

9
00:00:32,350 --> 00:00:42,340
You're the member I hate

10
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:44,180
You are too smart, right?

11
00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:47,140
I guessed it in less than three seconds, so

12
00:00:47,140 --> 00:00:49,330
You are the conductor, right?

13
00:00:49,330 --> 00:00:50,850
precious guest

14
00:00:50,930 --> 00:00:53,810
You spent over 100,000 on the Bloody Train

15
00:00:53,810 --> 00:00:56,050
Got the opportunity to upgrade services

16
00:00:56,050 --> 00:00:58,620
That's why I invited you to come to the office
